# Cached place extracts: the larger gzipped regional/global extracts (Overture,
# Foursquare, …) are binary blobs — track them with Git LFS so the repo stays
# lean. The small plain-text seed (seed-places.ndjson) is intentionally NOT LFS:
# it must be readable in a diff and usable with zero LFS setup.
*.ndjson.gz   filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
*.parquet     filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
